<div class="kicker"><a href="/">Moral Fiber Media</a> · section</div>
<h1>The <em>Puzzles</em></h1>
<div class="standfirst">Every puzzle we've built, by what it asks you to do. {{ livePuzzles | length }} live — each one built on the public record, with sources on every answer.</div>

<h2>Just the Facts</h2>
<p>One story from the record, cut into facts — match each claim to where it belongs. Every match reveals its sources. Newest first.</p>
<ul class="hub-list">
{%- set jtfFirst = true %}
{%- for p in puzzles.puzzles | reverse %}{% if p.template == "text-match" and p.status == "live" %}
  <li><span class="hub-num">text match</span>
      <a class="hub-t" href="/{{ p.path or ("puzzles/" + p.id) }}">"{{ p.title }}"</a>
      {% if jtfFirst %}<span class="hub-new">New</span>{% set jtfFirst = false %}{% endif %}
      <span class="hub-hook">{{ p.hook }}</span></li>
{%- endif %}{% endfor %}
</ul>

<h2>Rankings &amp; timelines</h2>
<p>Put the record in order — rank the numbers, sequence the events, call higher-or-lower. Sources on every answer.</p>
<ul class="hub-list">
{%- for p in puzzles.puzzles | reverse %}{% if (p.template == "rank" or p.template == "timeline" or p.template == "over-under") and p.status == "live" %}
  <li><span class="hub-num">{{ p.template | replace("-", " ") | replace("over under", "over/under") }}</span>
      <a class="hub-t" href="/{{ p.path or ("puzzles/" + p.id) }}">"{{ p.title }}"</a>
      <span class="hub-hook">{{ p.hook }}</span></li>
{%- endif %}{% endfor %}
</ul>

<h2>The bar-chart series</h2>
<p>Where it started: three companies, three donation profiles — match the company to the cash. Data from OpenSecrets.org, 2024 cycle.</p>
<ul class="hub-list">
{%- for p in barcharts %}{% if p.number %}
  <li><span class="hub-num">Puzzle #{{ p.number }}</span>
      <a class="hub-t" href="/puzzles/{{ p.id }}">"{{ p.title }}"</a>
      <span class="hub-hook">{{ p.hook }}</span></li>
{%- endif %}{% endfor %}
{%- for p in barcharts %}{% if not p.number %}
  <li><span class="hub-num">special</span>
      <a class="hub-t" href="/puzzles/{{ p.id }}">"{{ p.title }}"</a>
      <span class="hub-hook">{{ p.hook }}</span></li>
{%- endif %}{% endfor %}
</ul>

{%- if puzzles.coming_soon and puzzles.coming_soon.length %}
<h2>Coming soon</h2>
<p class="coming">
{%- for c in puzzles.coming_soon %}
  <b>"{{ c.title }}"</b> — {{ c.companies | join(" · ") }}{% if not loop.last %}<br>{% endif %}
{%- endfor %}
</p>
{%- endif %}

